---
kind: lore
id: east.trainersRoutes
title: Eastmarch route trainers (Routes 5-8, Lantern Tunnel)
---

// Who is out when: most trainers battle any time; the ones marked "night"
// only stand on their route after dark, the ones marked "day" go home at
// night. Their after-battle lines answer any time.

// ── Route 5: Portvolt north to the Lantern Tunnel, a meadow road ───────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r5BugCatcherMilo" who="r5BugCatcherMilo" intro="Shh! I've nearly got a cocoonix! Oh, it's you. Battle, then." win="My cocoonix never even hatched." lose="Bugs beat everything, eventually." prize="120"/>

<entry id="eastR5BugCatcherMiloAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r5BugCatcherMilo" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r5BugCatcherMilo))">
  @r5BugCatcherMilo: My big sister won the bug contest at Wildmoor three times. She says I hold the net like a spoon.
</entry>

// day: Daisy picks flowers until the light goes
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r5LassDaisy" when="!@isNight" who="r5LassDaisy" intro="You walked right through my daisy chain! You owe me a battle!" win="And now my daisy chain AND my pride." lose="That's what you get for trampling." prize="210"/>

<entry id="eastR5LassDaisyAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r5LassDaisy" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r5LassDaisy))">
  @r5LassDaisy: Bloomfield has flowers that only open on Sundays. Everybody says so. I've never seen one.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r5HikerGrant" who="r5HikerGrant" intro="Going through the tunnel? Warm up on me first, then!" win="Whew! Good stretch, that." lose="Legs of iron, monsters of stone!" prize="350"/>

<entry id="eastR5HikerGrantAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r5HikerGrant" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r5HikerGrant))">
  @r5HikerGrant: The Lantern Tunnel had lamps all the way through, once. Then the power plant closed and the lamps went dark.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r5CamperReed" who="r5CamperReed" intro="I've camped here three nights! I know every monster on this road!" win="I didn't know THAT one." lose="Three nights! Told you!" prize="180"/>

<entry id="eastR5CamperReedAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r5CamperReed" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r5CamperReed))">
  @r5CamperReed: At night the voltmouse come out of the long grass. Their tails glow. It's the best thing in the world.
</entry>

// night: June is only out for the fireflies
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r5PicnickerJune" when="@isNight" who="r5PicnickerJune" intro="Out after dark too? Then you're brave enough to battle!" win="Oh! I dropped my lantern." lose="The fireflies are cheering for me!" prize="200"/>

<entry id="eastR5PicnickerJuneAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r5PicnickerJune" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r5PicnickerJune))">
  @r5PicnickerJune: I come out every night to watch the voltmouse glow. Nobody believes how pretty it is.
</entry>

// ── Lantern Tunnel: dark without Flash ─────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="lanternTunnelHikerOrrin" who="lanternTunnelHikerOrrin" intro="Oof! You walked straight into me! Where did that light come from?" win="Bright AND strong. Unfair." lose="I know this tunnel in the dark. You don't." prize="360"/>

<entry id="eastLanternTunnelHikerOrrinAfter" on="talk" target="npc.lanternTunnelHikerOrrin" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(lanternTunnelHikerOrrin))">
  @lanternTunnelHikerOrrin: I've been lost in here for two days. Don't tell anyone. I'm a professional.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="lanternTunnelCollectorVik" who="lanternTunnelCollectorVik" intro="My collection is the rarest in Eastmarch! Look upon it and weep!" win="My collection! It's still rare! It's still RARE!" lose="Weep, I said. Weep!" prize="480"/>

<entry id="eastLanternTunnelCollectorVikAfter" on="talk" target="npc.lanternTunnelCollectorVik" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(lanternTunnelCollectorVik))">
  @lanternTunnelCollectorVik: They say a bird of pure lightning nests in the old power plant. I'd give my whole collection to see it. Well. Half.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="lanternTunnelHikerBess" who="lanternTunnelHikerBess" intro="Nearly out! See the daylight? You'll have to get past me to reach it!" win="Go on, then. Go and see the sky." lose="Back into the dark with you!" prize="370"/>

<entry id="eastLanternTunnelHikerBessAfter" on="talk" target="npc.lanternTunnelHikerBess" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(lanternTunnelHikerBess))">
  @lanternTunnelHikerBess: Ashgrove's on the other side. Quiet town. Too quiet, since those people in black climbed the tower.
</entry>

// ── Route 6: Ashgrove to Bloomfield, a river road ────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r6BeautyIris" when="!@isNight" who="r6BeautyIris" intro="I'm on my way to Bloomfield for perfume. You're in my way." win="My perfume money!" lose="Out of my way, then." prize="640"/>

<entry id="eastR6BeautyIrisAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r6BeautyIris" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r6BeautyIris))">
  @r6BeautyIris: Anise in Bloomfield mixes a scent that makes grass monsters purr. I'm told. Allegedly. I need three bottles.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r6JugglerNico" who="r6JugglerNico" intro="Watch the balls, not the monsters! Ha! Too late!" win="I dropped them. I dropped them all." lose="Ta-da!" prize="500"/>

<entry id="eastR6JugglerNicoAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r6JugglerNico" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r6JugglerNico))">
  @r6JugglerNico: Five balls is easy. Five monster capsules, now, that's a way to lose a finger.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r6BirdKeeperWren" who="r6BirdKeeperWren" intro="My birds spotted you from a mile off! Wings up!" win="Grounded. Every one of them." lose="Nothing outflies my flock!" prize="420"/>

<entry id="eastR6BirdKeeperWrenAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r6BirdKeeperWren" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r6BirdKeeperWren))">
  @r6BirdKeeperWren: Fern teaches Fly to trainers who beat her. My birds could carry you from here to Hollowtown before lunch.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r6PicnickerTess" when="!@isNight" who="r6PicnickerTess" intro="The river's perfect for a picnic! And a battle!" win="My sandwiches went in the river." lose="Picnic victory!" prize="220"/>

<entry id="eastR6PicnickerTessAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r6PicnickerTess" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r6PicnickerTess))">
  @r6PicnickerTess: I saw a boy with spiky hair running this way. He said he'd already beaten the Bloom Gym. He had leaves in his hair.
</entry>

// night: Lou plays cards under the bridge by lantern-light
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r6GamblerLou" when="@isNight" who="r6GamblerLou" intro="Double or nothing, kid? No? Then just the battle." win="House loses. Happens once a decade." lose="House always wins, kid." prize="900"/>

<entry id="eastR6GamblerLouAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r6GamblerLou" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r6GamblerLou))">
  @r6GamblerLou: There's a game corner in Silvercrest. Men in black keep going in and never coming out. Bad odds, I call that.
</entry>

// ── Route 7: Bloomfield west to Silvercrest, the cycling road ────────────

// night: the bikers own the road after dark
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r7BikerRex" when="@isNight" who="r7BikerRex" intro="This road's ours after dark! Pay the toll!" win="Aw, man! My paint job!" lose="Toll paid. Beat it." prize="580"/>

<entry id="eastR7BikerRexAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r7BikerRex" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r7BikerRex))">
  @r7BikerRex: We're not a gang. We're a cycling club. With a gang's attitude.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r7CueBallKnox" when="@isNight" who="r7CueBallKnox" intro="What're you looking at? My head? Nobody looks at my head!" win="Stop looking at my head." lose="Heh. Shiny AND tough." prize="600"/>

<entry id="eastR7CueBallKnoxAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r7CueBallKnox" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r7CueBallKnox))">
  @r7CueBallKnox: I polish it every morning. Every morning. You think this shine happens by itself?
</entry>

// day: Otto only cycles in daylight
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r7SuperNerdOtto" when="!@isNight" who="r7SuperNerdOtto" intro="Statistically, you should lose. Let me show you the maths!" win="My maths! My beautiful maths!" lose="Q.E.D." prize="440"/>

<entry id="eastR7SuperNerdOttoAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r7SuperNerdOtto" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r7SuperNerdOtto))">
  @r7SuperNerdOtto: There are one hundred and fifty-one kinds of monster in Verdane. I've seen twelve. Statistically that's a start.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r7BlackbeltKen" who="r7BlackbeltKen" intro="Hoo-hah! I train on this hill every day! Face me!" win="Hah! Good form! Good spirit!" lose="Hoo-hah! Train harder!" prize="640"/>

<entry id="eastR7BlackbeltKenAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r7BlackbeltKen" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r7BlackbeltKen))">
  @r7BlackbeltKen: Up the hill, down the hill. Up the hill, down the hill. That is the whole secret.
</entry>

// ── Route 8: Portvolt down the coast to the old power plant ─────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r8FishermanGus" who="r8FishermanGus" intro="Something's biting! Oh. It's you." win="Threw my line in the wrong water." lose="Reeled you right in." prize="380"/>

<entry id="eastR8FishermanGusAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r8FishermanGus" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r8FishermanGus))">
  @r8FishermanGus: Fish don't bite near the plant. Something in there hums, and they don't like it.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r8EngineerVolk" when="!@isNight" who="r8EngineerVolk" intro="I worked the plant twenty years. It's still running, you know. Nobody's switched it on." win="Tripped the breaker on me." lose="Twenty years of practice, kid." prize="600"/>

<entry id="eastR8EngineerVolkAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r8EngineerVolk" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r8EngineerVolk))">
  @r8EngineerVolk: When the storms come in off the sea, all the lights in the plant come on at once. Nobody's paid the bill since I left.
</entry>

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r8SwimmerCora" when="!@isNight" who="r8SwimmerCora" intro="The water's lovely! Come on in! Or battle me, I suppose." win="Sunk!" lose="Splash!" prize="300"/>

<entry id="eastR8SwimmerCoraAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r8SwimmerCora" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r8SwimmerCora))">
  @r8SwimmerCora: I swim to the lighthouse and back every morning. Keeper Sol waves. I think he waves. It might be a flag.
</entry>

// night: Nix is only here when the lights are out
<beat use="trainerBattle" id="r8BurglarNix" when="@isNight" who="r8BurglarNix" intro="You didn't see me. And you won't see your prize money either!" win="Fine! You saw me! Happy?" lose="Thanks for the donation." prize="700"/>

<entry id="eastR8BurglarNixAfter" on="talk" target="npc.r8BurglarNix" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(r8BurglarNix))">
  @r8BurglarNix: I was only going to borrow the copper from the plant. Then something in there looked at me. I'm going straight now.
</entry>

// ── the old power plant ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

<beat use="trainerBattle" id="powerPlantEngineerTamsin" who="powerPlantEngineerTamsin" intro="Who let you in? This is a restricted site! I'm... restricting it!" win="Fine. Fine! But don't touch the big switch." lose="Restricted. Told you." prize="720"/>

<entry id="eastPowerPlantEngineerTamsinAfter" on="talk" target="npc.powerPlantEngineerTamsin" category="bark" when="holds(defeated(powerPlantEngineerTamsin))">
  @powerPlantEngineerTamsin: The council sent me to find out why Portvolt's lights keep flickering. It's not the wiring. The wiring is terrified.
</entry>
